==Mauville City==
[[File:Mauville City RS.png|thumb|Mauville City]]

[[Mauville City]] is located in central [[Hoenn]], at the intersection of Routes {{rtn|110|Hoenn}} to the south, {{rtn|111|Hoenn}} to the north, {{rtn|117|Hoenn}} to the west, and {{rtn|118|Hoenn}} to the east. [[Rydel's Cycles|A bicycle shop]] in the northeast offers several different models for weary travelers. At the [[Mauville Game Corner]], patrons try their luck in the hopes of winning big. The [[Mauville Gym]] stands in the northwest part of the city.

