==Verdanturf Town==
[[File:Verdanturf Town RS.png|thumb|Verdanturf Town]]

[[Verdanturf Town]] is a small town at the west end of {{rt|117|Hoenn}}. Due to the prevailing wind pattern, the area is always kept clear of falling volcanic ash. The local [[Contest Hall]] holds Normal Rank competitions, the first step for every aspiring [[Pokémon Coordinator]].

